From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Vogelaar <revogelaar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 13:35:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] easymesh: decode the encoded Primary VLAN ID key

The EasyMesh policy encoder writes the Default 802.1Q Settings Policy key as
"Primary VLAN ID", but decode_em_policy_object() looks for the misspelled
"Primay VLAN ID".  A Policy Configuration Request therefore reaches the
agent and is translated by unified-wifi-mesh, but OneWifi rejects its own
encoded WifiEMConfig subdocument before applying any policy.  The controller
retries until the set_policy command times out, leaving PolicyList empty and
AP/STA metrics collection disabled.

Use the same spelling as the encoder and the EasyMesh data model.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Rob Vogelaar <revogelaar@gmail.com>
---
 source/webconfig/wifi_decoder.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/source/webconfig/wifi_decoder.c b/source/webconfig/wifi_decoder.c
index 3a5d452..65ce20a 100644
--- a/source/webconfig/wifi_decoder.c
+++ b/source/webconfig/wifi_decoder.c
@@ -6664,7 +6664,7 @@ webconfig_error_t decode_em_policy_object(const cJSON *policy_obj,
     // Default 802.1Q Settings Policy
     def_8021q_policy = cJSON_GetObjectItem(policy_obj, "Default 802.1Q Settings Policy");
     if (def_8021q_policy != NULL) {
-        decode_param_integer(def_8021q_policy, "Primay VLAN ID", param);
+        decode_param_integer(def_8021q_policy, "Primary VLAN ID", param);
         em_config->default_8021q_policy.primary_vid = (unsigned short)param->valuedouble;
         decode_param_integer(def_8021q_policy, "Default PCP", param);
         em_config->default_8021q_policy.default_pcp = (unsigned char)param->valuedouble;
